      <p>SANTACO is a democratic structure that flows from the grassroots associations up to the national executive.</p></div>
    <div class="gov-grid reveal">
      <div class="gov"><div class="gn">01</div><h3>National Conference</h3><p>The highest decision-making body, where delegates from all provinces elect leadership and set policy direction every four years.</p></div>
