<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- Hlokomela -->
    <div class="prog reveal" id="hlokomela">
      <div class="photo prog-media"><img src="https://santaco.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Programme@2x-770x650.png" alt="Hlokomela road safety campaign" onerror="this.classList.add('fail')"><span class="flabel">SANTACO · Hlokomela</span></div>
      <div class="prog-body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Road Safety · since 2010</span>
        <h2>Hlokomela Campaign</h2>
        <p>“Hlokomela” means to take care. Launched in November 2010 to complement government's Arrive Alive campaign, Hlokomela is SANTACO's flagship road-safety programme. It drives awareness of safe driving, oversees driver training and promotes a culture where every operator and driver takes responsibility for the lives they carry.</p>
        <p>The campaign runs roadshows and activations at ranks and along major corridors, especially ahead of high-traffic festive and Easter periods, partnering with traffic authorities and the RTMC to reduce crashes and fatalities.</p>
        <div class="prog-facts">
          <div class="pf"><b>2010</b><span>Year launched</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>9</b><span>Provinces reached</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Year-round</b><span>Driver training &amp; activations</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Women -->
    <div class="prog reveal" id="women">
      <div class="photo prog-media"><img src="https://santaco.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Asset-6_1@2x-770x650.png" alt="Ugu Region Women's Initiative" onerror="this.classList.add('fail')"><span class="flabel">SANTACO · Women's Initiative</span></div>
      <div class="prog-body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Empowerment</span>
        <h2>Ugu Region Women's Initiative</h2>
        <p>Building on SANTACO's national Women's Desk (established 2015), the Ugu Region Women's Initiative advances the role and leadership of women across the taxi industry — as operators, administrators, owners and executives.</p>
        <p>The initiative creates pathways into ownership and management, supports enterprise development, and ensures women's voices shape decision-making in a sector where they have historically been under-represented.</p>
        <div class="prog-facts">
          <div class="pf"><b>2015</b><span>Women's Desk founded</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Ugu</b><span>KwaZulu-Natal region</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Leadership</b><span>Ownership &amp; enterprise</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Academy -->
    <div class="prog reveal" id="academy">
      <div class="photo prog-media"><img src="https://santaco.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Asset-7@2x-1-770x650.png" alt="SANTACO Training Academy" onerror="this.classList.add('fail')"><span class="flabel">SANTACO · Training Academy</span></div>
      <div class="prog-body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Skills &amp; Training</span>
        <h2>SANTACO Training Academy</h2>
        <p>The Training Academy professionalises the industry from the ground up. It delivers structured development for drivers, operators and administrators — covering safe driving, customer service, vehicle care, financial management and association governance.</p>
        <p>By standardising skills and certification across provinces, the academy raises service quality for commuters and strengthens the business capability of taxi associations and operators.</p>
        <div class="prog-facts">
          <div class="pf"><b>Drivers</b><span>Safe driving &amp; conduct</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Operators</b><span>Business &amp; finance</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Associations</b><span>Governance &amp; admin</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Street Governor -->
    <div class="prog reveal" id="street-governor">
      <div class="photo prog-media"><img src="https://santaco.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/SA-Taxi.jpg" alt="Street Governor community safety project" onerror="this.classList.add('fail')"><span class="flabel">SANTACO · Community Safety</span></div>
      <div class="prog-body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Community Safety</span>
        <h2>Street Governor Project</h2>
        <p>The Street Governor Project mobilises the taxi industry's deep presence in communities to support public safety. Operators and drivers — who are on the roads and in the ranks every day — act as eyes and ears that help protect commuters, infrastructure and businesses.</p>
        <p>The project reflects SANTACO's view that the industry is a community institution with a responsibility beyond transport, working alongside local stakeholders to keep neighbourhoods and routes safe.</p>
        <div class="prog-facts">
          <div class="pf"><b>Local</b><span>Community partnerships</span></div>
          <div class="pf"><b>Daily</b><span>Presence in ranks &amp; routes</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

