      <div class="prog-body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Community Engagement</span>
        <h2>Community Engagement Initiatives</h2>
        <p>SANTACO invests back into the communities the industry serves through outreach, social-responsibility drives and stakeholder engagement — from supporting commuters during disruptions to participating in national campaigns and provincial roadshows.</p>
        <p>These initiatives strengthen trust between operators, commuters and government, reinforcing the taxi industry's role as a partner in social and economic development.</p>
